        "text": "tailLag d t = tailNumerator d t / tailShape d t, with tailNumerator d t = exp (-(1 - d.h)*t) * (primitive (weightedTailDerivative d) 3 - primitive (weightedTailDerivative d) t) and weightedTailDerivative d v = exp ((1 - d.h)*v) * tailShapeDeriv d v"
